   "source": [
    "# Problem Statement and Data Description"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "295b6075-9388-4c05-a433-b6c967e09968",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Tawian Global is a fictional finical institution that is looking into the number of clients who default on \\\n",
    "their monthly payments. Customer default is a concern for the bank because it leads to account charge off which\\\n",
    "forces Taiwan Global to absorb the cost of the remaining balance. The more clients who default the more revenue\\\n",
    "the institution looses. They'd like to address customer defaults early on and in house through clinet outreach\\\n",
    "directed at the clients who are most likely to default on the following months payement. In order to do so,\\\n",
    "they've brought in a team of data scientist to perform predictiev analytics on a sample of 30,000 clients. The\\\n",
    "goal is to create a classification model that accurately predicts customer default and ranks their customers'\\\n",
    "propensities to default on a payment."
   ]
  },
